    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\n'mini.basics' is intended to be a set of very basic settings and mappings. The presence of `toggle_diagnostic()` was more of a necessity because there was no other way to achieve the result. Due to it needing extra function, it was almost not a part of 'mini.basics'.\n\nSo that's said:\n- Toggling quickfix and loclist require a function. There is planned 'mini.quickfix' that would export it, so I'd not make it part of 'mini.basics'.\n- The diagnostic virtual lines and text is a bit too specific of a use case. They also don't really have any good/obvious suffixes to automatically create.\n\nSo I think I am going to close this as not planned.",
